# EVENT — it sets off a world event he wished for (E5): the wave, the meteor, the quake.
#
# The event itself is a kept design, staged by name where the item is aimed; everything about it —
# what it is made of, what it catches, what follows, how it is given back — lives in the design,
# not here. `moddyevent stage` is the only part of that command a function may run.
function effect()
    /moddyevent stage ${DESIGN} at ~ ~ ~
end
